app_user -- relationship10 [headlabel="1" labeldistance=1.7]; relationship10 -- app_session [taillabel="0..N" labeldistance=1.7];
label="PantryPal conceptual ER diagram — Chen notation
Rectangle: entity   Diamond: relationship   Ellipse: attribute   Underline: primary key
Selected attributes shown for readability; schema.sql lists every column.
Labels describe the number of related rows at each end."; labelloc=b; fontsize=14; }